ssion; head preserves ship-from Name, submits one native box POST and reloads the saved 8×6×4in/3oz box. Fresh Node24.22.0 full verification passes: 67 plugin/repository and 87 Workers tests, both typechecks, 26,012-byte Registry backend, dry builds/release and raw-entry checks; owning GitHub tests pass. One fresh re-review was requested; review accepts the served proof at 5/6 with no findings and maintainers have now merged it. Local workerd/SQLite and a synthetic issuer are not shared-service deployment; live packing remains unchanged.</DashboardEvidence></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/saarius/template-store/tree/fix/selected-variant-jsonld">saarius/template-store · fix/selected-variant-jsonld</a></td><td><DashboardEvidence summary="Open · #214 prevents borrowed member identifiers and documents the legacy no-Offer fallback. Head 40e95ea passes owning CI; signed plugin unchanged."><a href="https://github.com/dinkuskit/template-store/pull/214">PR #214</a> at <a href="https://github.com/saarius/template-store/commit/40e95ea">40e95ea</a>, open with full new-head CI green and re-review requested. Metadata behavior is dogfooded here: no borrowed identifiers; older member payloads produce page facts without an Offer. The theme’s later visible-identifier repair is merchant-only, not part of this PR. New public member SKUs enable their own Offer in disposable paired-runtime checks. Node 24.22.0 typecheck, 591 unit and 118 workflow tests, targeted desktop/phone checks on both payload generations and the credential-free Registry build pass. After correcting stale policy-test expectations, GitHub’s full desktop, phone and aggregate checks pass at this head; the longer local admin/policy rerun still crashes before those assertions. The body now embeds captured anonymous public facts beside resulting JSON-LD at unchanged main 62949c8/head f4c6174 for both projections: 24 selected cases and eight preserved simple-product Offers at 1440/390px, without response inter